  "description": "\"If you wrote me, then you can give me the throne!\" \n\nYoonsoo is the successful author of a popular fantasy series. Just as she's about to start work on a new series, Imperial Prince Kyte Einzen, the worst villain she created has kidnapped her into the world of her own story?! Can she mold this nightmare into a story that will turn both their fates around? Based on the hit novel.\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
